 when enemies are nearby. Very few people know how it's able to tell friendlies and hostiles apart."],["furni_R6_downlight_R_01","Exhibition Room Main Ceiling Light",2,200,[12,4,1],"","Normal lighting found in the training grounds. The effects of artificial light on Team Rainbow operators appear to be minimal."],["furni_R6_wallpaper_01","Destructible Walls",2,225,[34,1,10],"","The wallpaper used in the special equipment exhibition room. All signs of damage are merely for demonstrative purposes. Please refrain from causing any actual damage."],["furni_R6_deployableShield_01","Portable Shield",2,250,[5,3,4],"","A tactical shield that can be quickly deployed to provide defensive cover and fortification. They are bulletproof, but they don't stand a chance against any explosives."]],"theme":["Special Equipment Exhibition Room","An equipment exhibition room constructed based on the Team Rainbow operators' memories. Most of the equipment found inside are merely replicas."],"sets":[["Exhibition Room Furnishings",6,325],["Defense Team Active Installation",6,155],["Defense Team Passive Installation",6,240],["Exhibition Room Layout",6,195]]},"story":{"id":"act17d0","eps":[["OD-ST-1","Interlude"],["OD-1","Before Operation"],["OD-1","After Operation"],["OD-2","Before Operation"],["OD-2","After Operation"],["OD-3","Before Operation"],["OD-3","After Operation"],["OD-5","Before Operation"],["OD-5","After Operation"],["OD-6","Before Operation"],["OD-6","After Operation"],["OD-ST-2","Interlude"],["OD-7","Before Operation"],["OD-7","After Operation"],["OD-8","Before Operation"],["OD-8","After Operation"],["OD-ST-3","Interlude"]],"sum":1,"scene":1}}